    "name": "Don't Shoot The Humans!",
    "steam_appid": 3364810,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364810/extras/2e7f4e07b2aee4ed3f8bd6872dff43d8.avif?t=1743568280\" data-has-big width=800 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Shoot the Humans!</strong> is a  horror-detective game that immerses you in a tense first-person journey of life-or-death decisions. <br><br>Armed with only a single firearm and your instincts, you\u2019ll encounter eerie, humanoid figures shrouded in darkness. Each figure presents an impossible choice: shoot or save.    <br> <br>If you mistakenly shoot a human or spare a non-human, the consequences are deathly and the game is over.  <br> <br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense Life and death decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigative game play\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden clues and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear storytelling<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364810/extras/25bbe01a9b30cef607f2aba1fb27d8e9.avif?t=1743568280\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Shoot the Humans!</strong> delivers a tense, atmospheric blend of moral dilemma, investigative gameplay, and psychological horror. Can you decide friend from foe or will one wrong choice doom you to a fate worse than death? Every shot counts.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364810/extras/2e7f4e07b2aee4ed3f8bd6872dff43d8.avif?t=1743568280\" data-has-big width=800 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Shoot the Humans!</strong> is a  horror-detective game that immerses you in a tense first-person journey of life-or-death decisions. <br><br>Armed with only a single firearm and your instincts, you\u2019ll encounter eerie, humanoid figures shrouded in darkness. Each figure presents an impossible choice: shoot or save.    <br> <br>If you mistakenly shoot a human or spare a non-human, the consequences are deathly and the game is over.  <br> <br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense Life and death decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigative game play\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden clues and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear storytelling<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364810/extras/25bbe01a9b30cef607f2aba1fb27d8e9.avif?t=1743568280\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Shoot the Humans!</strong> delivers a tense, atmospheric blend of moral dilemma, investigative gameplay, and psychological horror. Can you decide friend from foe or will one wrong choice doom you to a fate worse than death? Every shot counts.</p>",
